 "\nThe capped reducer is given by the product of the cap above, with the \
reducer encoded by:\n\n\
Reducer:=M[2,1,12,11]M[4,3,14,13]M[6,5,13,15]M[8,7,16,18]M[10,9,18,17]M[15,14,\
17,16].\n"
