  "89c4e065-6736-4f16-995d-af8cfc3f43d5"],
 "\nWe consider the 6 spokes to be part of the region inside the dotted \
circle, and not part of the cap.  In the precap, when a cap arc approaches \
one of these edges, it may do so from the left or the right.  We choose one \
of the options below and discard the other.  For our example, above, the code \
below specifies the following cap:\narc[1,12] arc[2,11] arc[3,10] arc[4,7] \
arc[5,8] arc[6,9] V[4,6]\nNote that this corresponds to the picture in the \
center, above.  "
}], "Text",
